## BrainKernel Implementation Target

```rust
impl BrainKernel for HacedleBrain {
    fn model_id(&self) -> &str { "qwen2.5-0.5b" }
    
    async fn reason(&self, ctx: ReasonCtx) -> Result<ReasonResult, BrainError> {
        let tokens = self.inference.infer(
            &ctx.prompt,
            ctx.max_tokens.unwrap_or(64)
        );
        
        Ok(ReasonResult {
            content: tokens,
            confidence: 0.95,
        })
    }
}
```

## Dispatch Flow

```text
CLI (hace brain run)
  ↓
BrainModule.handle()
  ↓
RuntimeDispatcher.dispatch()
  ↓
CandleBrain.execute() [or ProviderFactory]
  ↓
HacedleBrain.reason()
  ↓
InferenceEngine
  ↓
Real token
```